Comment:
 According to the README file, the copyright notice applies to the original
 source code of Micropolis (in src/sim/) as well as to the X11 Tk port of
 Micropolis (in res/*.tcl), and to all of the non-text files in this source
 code release, including:
 .
 cities/*                          All loadable city images
 images/*                          All graphical images
 activity/activity-micropolis.svg  Icon for Micropolis in Sugar
 res/hexa.*                        Map Graphics
 res/snro.*                        Scenarios
 res/sounds/*                      Sounds played by the game
 res/stri.*                        Text strings displayed by the game
 .
 According to manual/README, the same copyright and license applies to:
 .
 manual/*                          documentation for Micropolis

